# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Environment Variables — Copy to .env and fill in your keys
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# OpenRouter (for LLM prompt generation) — FREE
# Get your key at: https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-your-key-here

# NVIDIA NIM (for image generation) — FREE tier
# Get your key at: https://build.nvidia.com/
NVIDIA_API_KEY=nvapi-your-key-here

# Hugging Face (fallback image generation) — FREE tier
# Get your token at: https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
HF_TOKEN=hf_your-token-here

# Pollinations.ai — NO KEY NEEDED (always works as primary)
